<title>BELARUS: Belarussian rouble flat at 14,600 to dlr in Minsk.</title>
<headline>Belarussian rouble flat at 14,600 to dlr in Minsk.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble was unchanged at 14,600 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange.</p>
<p>				    September 18	  September 17</p>
<p> Rate to dollar		    14,600		  14,600</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $4.701 million	    $2.359 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
